1
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,380
Bonjour, Adrien !
Hello, Adrien!

2
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:20,324
Bonjour, Marinette ! Ça va ?
Hello, Marinette! How are you?

3
00:00:20,424 --> 00:00:25,412
Ça va bien, merci. Et toi ?
I'm fine, thanks. And you?

4
00:00:25,512 --> 00:00:28,124
Ça va très bien !
I'm doing very well!

5
00:00:28,224 --> 00:00:31,580
Bonsoir, Marinette !
Good evening, Marinette!

6
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:35,900
Bonsoir ! À demain ?
Good evening! See you tomorrow?

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,436
Oui, à demain. Bonne nuit !
Yes, see you tomorrow. Good night!

8
00:00:40,536 --> 00:00:45,284
Bonne nuit, Adrien. Salut !
Good night, Adrien. Bye!
